runs/
# ...but the Rehearsal Research Program's runs ARE inspectable research memory — keep them.
# The first exception is the retired pre-vault path for branch compatibility; the second is
# the canonical home after the vault reorganisation; the third is the Foundry Sandbox runs,
# which are research memory on exactly the same footing (Markdown/JSON only, no weights).
!architecture-lab/rehearsals/runs/
!architecture-lab/rehearsals/runs/**
!vault/Build/Architecture Lab/Vision pipeline/rehearsals/runs/
!vault/Build/Architecture Lab/Vision pipeline/rehearsals/runs/**
!vault/Build/Architecture Lab/Vision pipeline/rehearsals/foundry/runs/
!vault/Build/Architecture Lab/Vision pipeline/rehearsals/foundry/runs/**
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
